Third-party materials
---------------------

Matrix-reasoning items in data/problems.json are taken from the public form
`kmiq-v1-20260826` of AI IQ (fun) v1:

    https://github.com/epoko77-ai/ai-iq-test

Copyright (c) the AI IQ (fun) authors.
Licensed under the MIT License.

The scoring formula (AI-IQ-FUN-v1), answer-tag parser, family names, and
entertainment labels follow that project's public specification. FunIQ is a
leaderboard and eval harness around the published form; it is not the
upstream project and does not claim authorship of the items.

Evaluation traffic is routed through timelyrouter.ai (OpenAI-compatible
Chat Completions). The FunIQ site layout is inspired by TigerBench
(https://tigerbench.vercel.app/) but is not a copy of their copy or CSS.
